{"text":"But I really want this to be interactive, so if you have a question, a comment, a doubt, a styling tip, you know, throw it out there, I'm here for it. I do not want this to be me speaking for 55 minutes and then leaving 30 seconds for interaction. Before we begin, I think we should give applause, also where it is due. I'm very lucky that here in the audience tonight I have mentors, I have some of my teachers, I have my family members. You know who you are. Can you please raise your hand and everybody else applaud them? Thank you very much. Because it really does take a village to raise a poet, and so I'll be singing their praise all through the night. So let's get started. I'm going to read a poem. I'm just keeping my phone so I can keep time, which I apologize if you've heard before, but this is a poem I wrote I want to say five years ago. And that I always recite because I think it's a great introduction into who I am. It's called Daughters Metro Map to City Identity.","words":[{"text":"But","start":0.0,"end":0.4},{"text":"I","start":0.4,"end":0.52},{"text":"really","start":0.52,"end":0.7},{"text":"want","start":0.7,"end":0.9},{"text":"this","start":0.9,"end":1.06},{"text":"to","start":1.06,"end":1.22},{"text":"be","start":1.22,"end":1.38},{"text":"interactive","start":1.38,"end":1.88,"punct":","},{"text":"so","start":2.26,"end":2.34},{"text":"if","start":2.34,"end":2.48},{"text":"you","start":2.48,"end":2.6},{"text":"have","start":2.6,"end":2.84},{"text":"a","start":2.84,"end":3.28},{"text":"question","start":3.28,"end":3.86,"punct":","},{"text":"a","start":4.1,"end":4.14},{"text":"comment","start":4.14,"end":4.64,"punct":","},{"text":"a","start":4.92,"end":4.92},{"text":"doubt","start":4.92,"end":5.36,"punct":","},{"text":"a","start":5.58,"end":5.68},{"text":"styling","start":5.68,"end":6.3},{"text":"tip","start":6.3,"end":6.68,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":6.9,"end":6.9},{"text":"know","start":6.9,"end":7.14,"punct":","},{"text":"throw","start":7.